{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/extras/081477a55bdf6cef7a67c7aa3b704da8.poster.avif?t=1745927075\" width=616 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/extras/081477a55bdf6cef7a67c7aa3b704da8.webm?t=1745927075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/extras/081477a55bdf6cef7a67c7aa3b704da8.mp4?t=1745927075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOU ARE THE OWNER OF THAT FAMOUS GUN SHOP!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is now your kingdom! Whenever customers need a reliable gunsmith, you are their first stop. As they browse your shelves, they feel your unique touch in every corner of the shop, ready to make a name for itself in the city. Come on, turn your shop into the place of your dreams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/extras/006e97d44f418eccaebd575283e0107c.poster.avif?t=1745927075\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/extras/006e97d44f418eccaebd575283e0107c.webm?t=1745927075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/extras/006e97d44f418eccaebd575283e0107c.mp4?t=1745927075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WITH A MASTER'S TOUCH, GUNS COME TO LIFE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon has a story, and it\u2019s up to you to continue it. Carefully examine incoming orders, identify the problems, and showcase your skills. Clean, repair, and renew the mechanisms! Step by step, you will be the one bringing these weapons back to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/extras/c6e58343a92808c305042a80c616ca86.poster.avif?t=1745927075\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/extras/c6e58343a92808c305042a80c616ca86.webm?t=1745927075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/extras/c6e58343a92808c305042a80c616ca86.mp4?t=1745927075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AS GOOD AS NEW: CLEAN AND READY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's an old rifle or a modern handgun, every weapon deserves a second chance. First, clean the weapons, then skillfully repair them. Replace the parts and restore the broken mechanisms. Now, that weapon is ready to shine again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/extras/722de707f4dcf6267a4cb1b4128c7731.poster.avif?t=1745927075\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/extras/722de707f4dcf6267a4cb1b4128c7731.webm?t=1745927075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/extras/722de707f4dcf6267a4cb1b4128c7731.mp4?t=1745927075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE FINAL TOUCH: POLYGON TEST!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every repaired weapon deserves a test drive. Head to the range and pull the trigger to test its cleanliness and accuracy. These tests are the best way to prove your professionalism. Plus, a few accurate shots can add to the fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/extras/632c84b93c264c78d259d8b4bf1b0464.poster.avif?t=1745927075\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/extras/632c84b93c264c78d259d8b4bf1b0464.webm?t=1745927075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/extras/632c84b93c264c78d259d8b4bf1b0464.mp4?t=1745927075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3195310?t=1745927075","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3195310?t=1745927075","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/c965fd85691b9bb45e5c271fe7162c67bd3db99e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745927075","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/c965fd85691b9bb45e5c271fe7162c67bd3db99e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745927075","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/extras/081477a55bdf6cef7a67c7aa3b704da8.poster.avif?t=1745927075\" width=616 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195310/extras/081477a55bdf6cef7a67c7aa3b704da8.webm?t=1745927075\" type=\"video/